    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the exciting world of Forest Fury - a 2D platformer in retro pixel art style. <br />\r\nThis is not just a game; it's an amazing journey where you become a powerful little witch on a mission to save the magical forest from terrifying monsters. <br />\r\nAs you step across colorful platforms, you will battle the creatures using your magic and cunning!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach level is filled with wonders and dangers, from magical flowers to sinister shadows lurking behind the trees.<br />\r\n With unique spells, you can create enchantments using ancient rituals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\nUnique spells<br />\r\nDiverse levels<br />\r\nVarious enemies<br />\r\nBright graphics and the atmosphere of a magical world.",
